            <td class="mt-align-center lt-chem-165344" data-th="titration reaction">\(\mathrm{Na}_{2} \mathrm{B}_{4} \mathrm{O}_{7}+2 \mathrm{H}_{3} \mathrm{O}^{+}+3 \mathrm{H}_{2} \mathrm{O} \rightarrow 2 \mathrm{Na}^{+}+4 \mathrm{H}_{3} \mathrm{BO}_{3}\)</td>
