            <td class="mt-align-center lt-chem-165344" data-th="titration reaction">\(\mathrm{KHC}_{8} \mathrm{H}_{4} \mathrm{O}_{4}+\mathrm{OH}^{-} \rightarrow \mathrm{K}^{+}+\mathrm{C}_{8} \mathrm{H}_{4} \mathrm{O}_{4}^{-}+\mathrm{H}_{2} \mathrm{O}\)</td>
